    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Pharmacology knowledge and skills are integral to nursing accountability in the administration of prescribed medicines. The School of Nursing and Midwifery and the Department of Biological and Biomedical Sciences in collaboration with CIME, organised a simulation workshop for MSc in Nursing (MScN) students, as part of their 'Advanced Practice in Pharmacology' course.",
